---
import { SITE } from '../lib/config.ts';
---
<footer>
  <div class="wrap cols">
    <div>
      <h3>Birchwood Cafe</h3>
      <p>
        Start and finish of the round.<br />Birchwood House, Main Street, Shap CA10 3NJ<br />Usually open Tuesday to
        Saturday, 9am to 4pm.
      </p>
      {SITE.instagram && <p><a href={SITE.instagram} rel="noopener">Birchwood Cafe on Instagram</a></p>}
      <p>Questions about the round? <a href="/contact/">Get in touch</a> — please don’t call the café.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Read and listen</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Alan Cleaver, <em>The Postal Paths</em> (Monoray, 2025)
          {SITE.bookUrl && <>{' · '}<a href={SITE.bookUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy the book</a></>}
        </li>
        <li>Alan Cleaver’s Hidden Cumbria route notes for the Shap postman’s path</li>
        <li>Countrystride podcast #43, Shap and the Postman’s Path</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Walk responsibly</h3>
      <p>
        Much of the route crosses working farmland. Keep dogs under control near stock, use gates and stiles, and leave
        no trace. <a href="/safety/">Safety and respect</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap legal">
    <p class="credit">
      Historical material drawn from Alan Cleaver’s <em>The Postal Paths</em> and used with kind permission.{' · '}<a
        href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>{' · '}<a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .legal { margin-top: 2rem; }
</style>
